This software is a faithful re-implementation ("port") of the Go programming
language's standard-library `regexp` and `regexp/syntax` packages, and its
algorithms, program structure, instruction set, and engine designs are derived
from that work. In addition, the generated Unicode data tables
(`src/fold_table.zig`, `src/unicode_tables.zig`) are produced directly from the
Go `unicode` package's data.

